Shrine Mascot was added in '''Beta 36.0''' as a 2/3 monster. Before its release, it was revealed with 1 ATK instead. It shares this release change with [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Space_Cooler Space Cooler].

'''Beta 36.1''' changed it again, one update after release. It shares this with [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Purple_Mascot Purple Mascot]. Its ATK returned to 1, but its HP went up to 4 instead.

